  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment Project of Cooperative Ubumwe Gatsibo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Koperative Ubumwe Gatsibo seeks to improve their capacity building and increase rice production through building adequate post-harvest handling infrastructure, improve transport logistics, and improve the availability of agricultural inputs through trainings and a revolving fund.</narrative>
  </description>
